{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being stuck with your friend sounds like fun- until it's not. Help Walter and Jellybean avoid a cursed fate of being forever linked at the wrists, and capture the wizard to undo the spell. This is two player cooperative platformer adventure. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Features TEAMWORK</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Scale different platforms throughout the city with the power of love and friendship! (or lack thereof) </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>PLATFORMING HIJINKS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Move through puzzles and unique areas to capture the wizard causing mayhem in the world around him. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>THE CHUMPS</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Who are you? Play as Walter, our serious chump with a soft spot (likely under his hat), or as Jellybean, a silly little goober filled with whimsy from their crown to their toes.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3510390?t=1742116992","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3510390?t=1742116992","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510390/d63e7d7624258684c4c6b3ea60b676f9444c60da/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1742116992","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3510390/d63e7d7624258684c4c6b3ea60b676f9444c60da/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1742116992","categories":[{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen Co-op","id":39},{"description":"Shared/Split Screen","id":24},{"description":"Partial Controller Support","id":18},{"description":"Remote Play Together","id":44},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Being stuck with your friend sounds like fun- until it's not. Help Walter and Jell